      "Published October 12, 2026. Secure Print Release Queue Handoff for Outsourced Support begins when a customer submits a confidential print job but cannot see, authenticate to, release, or cancel it at the expected device. The immediate goal is not to guess a technical cause. It is to preserve the customer’s actual problem, prevent an irreversible shortcut, and move one decision-ready record to the person who owns the system or policy. Open case OHS-B03 with local time, customer impact, current safe state, and the next promised update.",
