    "slug": "helpdesk-webhook-retry-duplicate-event-report",
    "title": "Webhook Retry Duplicate Event Report for Help Desk Handoffs",
    "excerpt": "A practical webhook retry and duplicate event handling workflow for evidence, customer checkpoints, accountable decisions, testing, and verified closure.",
    "minutes": 9,
